    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ProjectAnalysisOrchestrator\n\nDrives Aniol's analysis pipeline for one close-project run. Called async by the ProjectClose tool with a project_analysis_run id. See darwin/plans/close-project.md in pidgeon-head.\n\n**Stages:** L0 script-parser (only when the project has zero questions — L0 inserts blindly and a re-run duplicates the question set), L1 session-qa-analyst (only sessions with no session_answer rows — the emergent-question insert is not idempotent), L2 finalize-project-analysis (~12 min measured), L3 project-insight-synthesis.\n\n**Run-linkage guard:** L3 picks the latest L2 run itself. We verify its source_run_id equals our L2 run_id and fail the run on mismatch. One running run per project is enforced by a partial unique index in Supabase.\n\n**Timeouts:** the pipeline webhooks respond only on completion. L1/L0 15 min, L2/L3 45 min.\n\n**PROMOTION TODO:** webhook URLs are hardcoded to darwin-staging. Aniol's pipeline does not exist on production yet; switch to $vars-based base URL (or Execute-Workflow triggers) before promoting. Webhooks also have no auth yet (plan finding R3).",
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d7bfad83-e0ab-4f54-a275-0fffee1136bc",
      "name": "Sticky Note a0d3d6bf",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
